cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CosmoViewer in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "CosmoViewer: an interactive workbench for cosmological particle simulations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Arpit Pratap
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - N-body simulation
  - SPH
  - Gadget-4
  - HDF5
  - friends-of-friends
  - visualisation
abstract: >-
  CosmoViewer brings 3D visualisation, structure finding, particle tracking,
  quantitative analysis and movie making for particle simulations of the
  universe into one window. It reads single- and multi-file HDF5 snapshots from
  Gadget and Gadget-style codes, with their group catalogues, and keeps every
  measurement on the full-resolution particle population rather than the
  sample drawn on screen.
